From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 01:53:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: exynos: exynos9820-beyond2lte: Enable the
 embedded storage

The board carries the storage the SoC node describes, so turn it on.

Its supply is a regulator the boot loader leaves on and nothing here
switches, so it is not described.

Signed-off-by: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos9820-beyond2lte.dts | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos9820-beyond2lte.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos9820-beyond2lte.dts
index 72db040d28a..e78da54621f 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos9820-beyond2lte.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos9820-beyond2lte.dts
@@ -366,6 +366,10 @@ &serial0 {
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+&ufs_0 {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 /* This USI instance is wired as the touchscreen I2C master on this board. */
 &usi3 {
 	samsung,mode = <USI_V2_I2C>;
